ground maps. Choose different forecast layers like; rain, hurricanes, warnings or locations.\nThe rain layer quality covers high- (HD), normal- or low-resolution quality, and an option to choose between green, blue, red or grey color scheme.\nCustomize overlays by adjusting the layer opacity, the number of frames in the future/past and animation speed (f/s).\n\nSUPPORTED COUNTRIES AND REGIONS\nUnited States, Canada, Mexico\nEUROPE: France, United Kingdom, Germany, Spain, Portugal, Netherlands, Switzerland, Norway, Sweden, Finland, Denmark\nAPAC: Japan, Hong Kong, Korea, Taiwan & Australia\n\nWE LOVE FEEDBACK! --\nAs always, we appreciate your feedback.\nPlease keep sharing your experience to feedback@impalastudios.com\n\nEnjoying Storm Tracker and want more features?\nPlease show us some love by giving a 5-star review, so we can keep updating with great new features!\n\n-- YOUR EXTREME WEATHER RADAR --", "trackCensoredName": "Storm Tracker° Pro", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/storm-tracker-pro/id945662966?uo=4", "averageUserRating": 3, "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "languageCodesISO2A": ["DA", "NL", "EN", "FI", "FR", "DE", "IT", "JA", "KO", "NB", "PT", "ZH", "ES", "SV"], "fileSizeBytes": "421041152", "formattedPrice": "￦3,300", "trackContentRating": "4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 3, "sellerUrl": "https://impalastudios.com/apps/storm-radar", "artistId": 1063279743, "artistName": "Impala Studios", "userRatingCount": 1}]}